  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "後花園柴山"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭名芝</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">假日無議量ê下晡時，阮上愛去柴山peh山，運動衫、運動鞋換好就出發。柴山有幾若條路線thang peh，阮試行過幾條了後，有家己慣勢ê路線。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石坎路段是阮慣勢ê路線，拄開始ē先經過幾間涼水店，suà--落-來就開始peh。沿路互相消遣拍lā涼、講笑詼，peh一睏仔若忝頭就恬恬無講話欣賞風景。一tak久仔了後，聽著tshi-bú-tshi̍h-tshū ê聲音，沓沓仔行倚，聲是愈來愈大聲。聲齊響亮kánn-ná是合唱團leh演唱，跤步停--落-來，tī hia享受頭一擺ná一陣am-poo-tsê做伙響ê感受，hōo人聽kah耳仔phak-phak-phak。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">實在是真罕得聽--著，到tann iáu ē記得hit工ê情境。Tuè線路ê指示行，清幽ê路仔有時是鋪細粒石仔、有時是有坎仔ê平路，起起落落，ná行ná吹涼涼ê風，目睭看四箍liàn-tńg lóng是青ling-ling ê樹欉。沿路猴山--a一陣koh一陣，ē tī人身軀邊行來行去，有時看著驚kah phi̍h-phi̍h-tshuah，沓沓仔頭lê-lê行--過；細隻猴山--a恬靜恬靜，hōo老母抱tī胸坎leh sai-nai，完全無受人類干擾，有影真古錐。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中途不時mā ē聽著鳥仔ê叫聲，koh ē看著膨鼠tī樹欉peh kuân peh低、跳來跳去，實在真心適。Peh到kuân頂有一座觀景台ê亭仔，坐踮hia歇睏ê時，面對--ê是一phiàn大海，風景有夠開闊。海頂koh有停幾若隻船仔，日頭照tī水面，爍--leh爍--leh ê魚鱗光，湠開一絲一絲閃閃爍爍，hiah-nī suí ê景緻，hōo人心涼脾土開，忝頭kap跤痠lóng隨海風四散飛--去--ah！&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/s1421/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/w450-h640/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqeVE0cNMrvyS3TGOnUc2Ez9h-zFv5FuFFkg7f_PctDAVTEu8AM0-ocq7lYt11hfH8Ai3OXjqvxrn8sGrfMEtM8gHWXQ2EUGxkqB4ZFfE14nINp5CB_qGP2vcwRsT5GX2DEaeMD8-_SOGjmDdO1_W8m26IGIFwkWTzW-kc1dJ4BOd1eVbxuxvzTu5SBw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqeVE0cNMrvyS3TGOnUc2Ez9h-zFv5FuFFkg7f_PctDAVTEu8AM0-ocq7lYt11hfH8Ai3OXjqvxrn8sGrfMEtM8gHWXQ2EUGxkqB4ZFfE14nINp5CB_qGP2vcwRsT5GX2DEaeMD8-_SOGjmDdO1_W8m26IGIFwkWTzW-kc1dJ4BOd1eVbxuxvzTu5SBw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>光景bóng uē&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。<br /><